  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Wie viele Passwörter kannst du hacken?\n",
        "Auf dieser Seite wirst du versuchen, so viele Passwörter wie möglich aus einem gesicherten Datensatz zu entziffern. Diese Art und Weise wird in einer ähnlichen Form von professionellen Firmen und Hackern benutzt, um die Sicherheit von Passwörtern zu überprüfen.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Drücke in dem ersten Codeblock auf Play und scrolle dann runter zu dem ersten Angriff.**\n",
        "\n",
        "Viel Spass!"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "yC-SsFQOJSm7"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 3,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "I-9i0omEjks4"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# <------- WICHTIG!!! Drücke hier auf Play\n",
        "#\n",
        "# Verändere an diesem Code bitte überhaupt nichts!\n",
        "\n",
        "import hashlib\n",
        "import itertools\n",
        "from tqdm.notebook import tqdm\n",
        "\n",
        "def hash(input_string):\n",
        "    return hashlib.md5(input_string.encode()).hexdigest()\n",
        "\n",
        "def get_name_by_hash(d, hash_value):\n",
        "    for name, h in d.items():\n",
        "        if h == hash_value:\n",
        "            return name\n",
        "    return None  # If not found\n",
        "\n",
        "def generate_strings(chars, length):\n",
        "    \"\"\"Generates all possible strings of a given length using a character list.\"\"\"\n",
        "    for combination in itertools.product(chars, repeat=length):\n",
        "        yield \"\".join(combination)\n",
        "\n",
        "dataleak_dict = {\n",
        "    \"Alex\": \"83878c91171338902e0fe0fb97a8c47a\",\n",
        "    \"Béatrice\": \"45c48cce2e2d7fbdea1afc51c7c6ad26\",\n",
        "    \"Christophe\": \"2b9ed9314c9b75f085fcf7356337d30b\",\n",
        "    \"Daniela\": \"5f4dcc3b5aa765d61d8327deb882cf99\",\n",
        "    \"Elisabeth\": \"a384b6463fc216a5f8ecb6670f86456a\",\n",
        "    \"Fernanda\": \"25d55ad283aa400af464c76d713c07ad\",\n",
        "    \"Gilles\": \"5d793fc5b00a2348c3fb9ab59e5ca98a\",\n",
        "    \"Hannah\": \"afdd0b4ad2ec172c586e2150770fbf9e\",\n",
        "    \"Ilsa\": \"e7e06aff0e583c24313d7e96085aefa2\",\n",
        "    \"Jhempi\": \"b850780bb2b06e0cf81afb7a2efebb1a\",\n",
        "    \"Klara\": \"4fc963e213bba362778f5c175eb4d5ff\",\n",
        "    \"Louis\": \"7f320b406a0956586fcc21c9f18e9180\",\n",
        "    \"Maren\": \"41e4652a622b10077ff4c22717dc57fd\",\n",
        "    \"Nico\": \"5de2bcf647b707104e4513262903866c\",\n",
        "    \"Olivia\": \"a996822761d1ed5066d2a208d549442b\",\n",
        "    \"Pedro\": \"8acef4050a09ce337a04186afd44ed33\",\n",
        "    \"Quentin\": \"195f19b835efe9f0b7b4e276ef1a8515\",\n",
        "    \"Robert\": \"48e6c9d963b4ec1c7507c505d577a6ad\",\n",
        "    \"Svenja\": \"b365a69719188e80fdd9183e1f3f42cd\",\n",
        "    \"Tom\": \"f1174e62d60a92010c4a72fe87805ae1\",\n",
        "    \"Ulrike\": \"2caa178076a628d0958fee0eab337176\",\n",
        "    \"Victor\": \"4de8e33e649c6ee317c7937804b63fc1\",\n",
        "    \"Wilhelmina\": \"c5efd020ac6cb5ab5542c54c91cb45ea\",\n",
        "    \"Xenia\": \"38b77d171bec2ddcadcbf434355b4184\",\n",
        "    \"Yves\": \"5833fe44252e19198cb9310b3f54eaf2\",\n",
        "    \"Zelda\": \"8327d03221693ccea6df43e600008383\"\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "dataleak = list(dataleak_dict.values())\n"
        "print("Alles bereit! Du kannst loslegen!)\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Angriff Nummer 1!\n",
        "## Einfach probieren\n",
        "> Viele Benutzer*innen sind sehr unkreativ und benutzen sehr einfache Passwörter.\n",
        "Verändere den Text in der \"test_password\" Variable und schaue nach, ob deine Idee sich in den Daten befindet.\n",
        "\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "JIewO6w6tSpk"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# ===== Schreibe hier ein Passwort, um es zu testen =====\n",
        "test_password = \"blabla\"\n",
        "# ============================\n",
        "\n",
        "if hash(test_password) in dataleak:\n",
        "    name = get_name_by_hash(dataleak_dict, hash(test_password))\n",
        "    print(f\"Passwort gefunden: Dies ist {name}'s Passwort: {test_password}\")\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    print(f\"Passwort {test_password} nicht in den Daten gefunden!\")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "k0jNiw82n2qc",
        "outputId": "4a2b5fa7-1ab3-4ae3-ac02-7a446d06c720"
